REALROUTE 0.15
id split-inflation
claim_scope defeat-route-ontology
source_ontology O1
target_ontology O2
content x
source_route r root x COVERED
target_route r1 shared x
target_route r2 shared x
target_route r3 shared x
target_route r4 shared x
target_route r5 shared x
map r REFINE r1+r2+r3+r4+r5
coverage_witness r r1 x
authorize_coverage_authority HOLD_ROUTE_ANCESTRY_ENTANGLEMENT
authorize_coverage_equivalence YES
authorize_duplication YES
authorize_collapse NO
authorize_hidden_novel NO
authorize_ancestry_entanglement YES
authorize_path_conflict NO
END
